{{Quote|A mystical lamp with the essence of a clever fox. It illuminates the path with an otherworldly light.|Item}}
The '''Fox Lamp''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

The Fox Lamp is known for its [[stun]] ability and extremely fast [M1] attacks. It can be used to extend or initiate [[combos]] with its {{Ability|Z}} move. Fox Lamp is a powerful sword for PvP as well, having long stuns, [[Instinct]] breaks, high damage, and good combo potential, as well as great synergy with almost any fighting style. These traits make it very versatile, allowing it to work with any stat build. 

Its [M1] attacks make it a decent option for grinding with [[Buddha]] because of their short cooldown. However, its skills lack [[Area of Effect|AoE]] and proper stun for efficient grinding.

==Obtainment==
The Fox Lamp has a chance to be rewarded by the [[Kitsune Shrine]] upon offering 15 [[Azure Ember]]s or more to the [[Kitsune Shrine]] during the [[Blue Moon]].

